    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG Farrelly Southern are delighted to present this superb two-bedroom, first-floor apartment to the market. Recently renovated to a high standard throughout, the property is presented in excellent condition and offers bright, spacious and comfortable accommodation in a highly convenient Maynooth location.\n\nThe apartment has been renovated upgraded and benefits from a newly fitted kitchen with additional storage, a newly fitted bathroom, upgraded bedroom wardrobes, a new boiler. Presented in true turnkey condition, this attractive apartment is ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors seeking a property that is ready for immediate occupation.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a modern fitted kitchen, a bright and spacious living and dining area with access to a sunny balcony, two well-proportioned bedrooms and a contemporary bathroom. The balcony enjoys excellent natural sunlight throughout the day, providing an ideal space for outdoor seating and relaxation. The property also benefits from convenient parking to the front.\n\nStraffan Wood is a popular and well-established residential development, occupying a highly desirable position within Maynooth. The apartment is situated towards the end of a quiet cul-de-sac and is surrounded by mature landscaping and generous green areas. The development is well maintained by the management company and provides an attractive environment for residents.\n\nThe location is exceptionally convenient, within walking distance of Maynooth town centre and its wide selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, bars and leisure facilities. Maynooth University, primary and secondary schools, Maynooth Train Station and regular bus services are all easily accessible. The M4 motorway is also nearby, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre and the wider motorway network.\n\nThis beautifully presented apartment offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a turnkey home in one of Maynooth?s most popular residential developments. Early viewing is highly recommended.\n\nDisclaimer: We have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services. Interested parties should undertake their own investigations regarding the condition and working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs and floor plans are provided for guidance purposes only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (27.72ft x 4.23ft) <br>Living Room (19.55ft x 9.84ft) <br>Kitchen (12.63ft x 8.33ft) <br>Bedroom 1 (12.34ft x 9.42ft) <br>Bedroom 2 (9.25ft x 8.01ft) <br>Bathroom (7.22ft x 5.51ft) <br>Hotpress <br>Balcony "
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "First floor two-bedroom apartment built in 2005\nApprox. 64 sq.m. (689 sq.ft.) of well-proportioned accommodation\nRefurbished to a high standard throughout\nStylish newly fitted kitchen with additional storage\nContemporary newly fitted bathroom suite\nNew Ideal gas boiler, hot water cylinder and pump\nOriginal solid oak flooring and upgraded fitted wardrobes\nPrivate balcony enjoying excellent natural sunlight\nQuiet cul-de-sac location within the popular Straffan Wood development\nWalking distance to Maynooth town centre, Maynooth University, train station and excellent access to the M4 motorway\n\n"
